    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market 58 Edenmore Avenue, a three-bedroom end-of-terrace home ideally positioned within this established and popular residential development. Offering well-proportioned accommodation over two floors, the property will appeal to first-time buyers and families alike. \n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, a comfortable living room and a separate kitchen, together with a bathroom completing the ground floor. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms ( master with ensuite bathroom), providing excellent flexibility for family living, a home office or guest accommodation.\n\nThe property has been well maintained over the years and offers a practical and inviting home, while also providing scope for a new owner to personalise and update to their own taste over time. \n\nEdenmore Avenue is situated within a well-established residential setting with a host of local amenities close by, including shops, schools, recreational facilities and public transport links. The area also provides convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding suburbs.\n\nViewing of this property is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation and potential on offer.."
      },
